{
  "bodyHash": "+xB4vZqBb2Q=",
  "content": "<!--suppress HtmlDeprecatedAttribute -->\n\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\n沉浸式盔甲为游戏添加了大量符合原版风格且独特的盔甲套装。与那些无聊的复制粘贴盔甲不同，沉浸式盔甲专注于视觉增强的盔甲，部分配有披风或自定义模型。大多数盔甲提供专属效果，如狂暴模式、反弹、尖刺、神圣保护等。合成配方已正确注册在原版配方书中。附魔、修复、染色等功能均如预期般工作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>40 件新盔甲物品，持续增加中！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors%3Aarmor&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的图集图片\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>木制盔甲</h1>\n<p>不知道你怎么想，但我已经厌倦了被骷髅射手狙击。这套原始而有效的盔甲提供了相当不错的箭矢和爆炸防护。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髅盔甲</h1>\n<p>有没有想过把你的敌人变成盔甲？可能没有，但这里有一套轻量化的骷髅盔甲。让你移动更快，凋灵骷髅盔甲甚至能让骷髅不再攻击你。伤害任何试图触碰你的东西！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神圣盔甲</h1>\n<p>你想脱颖而出？给你，一套华丽的金红色盔甲。随意将布料染成你喜欢的颜色。除了外观漂亮和提供超常的防护外，一套完整的神圣盔甲每分钟可以完全抵挡一次攻击！</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型盔甲</h1>\n<p>高护甲值，高韧性，几乎无击退，代价是机动性。这套盔甲旨在碾压最强大的敌人。</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>黏液盔甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道，这看起来不像盔甲。但相信我，它管用。攻击你的敌人会被弹开，爆炸也不会造成太大伤害！不过穿上这个之后你可能会有点味道……</p>\n<img width=\"300\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>战士盔甲</h1>\n<p>这不仅仅是维京盔甲，穿上它，你就成为了维京人！造成更多斧头伤害，并且每损失一点生命值都会增加总体伤害。陷入狂暴模式，在残酷的近战搏斗中斩杀你的敌人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>长袍盔甲</h1>\n<p>蓬松、可染色的羊毛盔甲。注入了烈焰棒，对任何试图攻击你的人造成火焰伤害！哦，它还是防火的。因为烈焰棒。科学！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽朋克盔甲</h1>\n<p>旋转的齿轮、黄铜、指南针、时钟和大量烟雾。让我为你介绍最复杂的盔甲套装——蒸汽朋克盔甲。头盔配有敌对生物雷达系统，潜行时激活。胸甲提供增强的GUI，让你再也不会忘记时间！护腿装备了二段跳，靴子则通过集成的蒸汽喷射器完全防止摔落伤害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶石盔甲</h1>\n<p>利用守卫者的尖刺为你所用！这套带刺的盔甲会对攻击者造成，嗯，尖刺伤害。虽然坚固的岩石会减慢你的速度，但它也提供了深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>视频评测！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size: 16px; text-align: center;font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\"\nheight=\"480\" width=\"872\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品都已集成到原版配方书（以及任何像JEI这样的模组）中。骨头、铁块、海晶碎片、羊毛、黏液、活塞、皮革盔甲、长袍、凋灵骷髅头颅和木材是解锁配方所需的物品。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方图片\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>翻译</h1>\n<p>\n沉浸式盔甲通过机器翻译支持多种语言，但由于质量通常较差，欢迎你通过 <a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a> 加入翻译工作。\n<br/>\n欢迎对糟糕的翻译点踩，并提交你自己的翻译。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不兼容性</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模组（盔甲将使用简陋的备用模型）</p>\n<p>试图以降低透明度渲染盔甲的模组</p>\n\n<h1>整合</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hostile-humans\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile%20Humans&description=Adds%20Hostile%20Humans%20with%20structures%20into%20your%20world&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"敌对人类\"/>\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸式系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式盔甲\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式飞行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式旋律\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式画作\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式优化\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"选择性边框\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"多面手\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式机械\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式家具\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式传送门\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜欢颜色？有些盔甲套装是可染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\">\n截图中的光影是 Nostalgia Shader\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=1c6d81e57aac0f3dfbd4c31c7e6b7ae7\" alt=\"页面哈希值，便于页面部署。\"/>",
